					"TextMarkInlineMathContent": "O(n^2)"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " ，而我们即将学习的快速排序的时间复杂度为 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "inline-math",
					"TextMarkInlineMathContent": "O(n\\log⁡n)"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 。\n尽管插入排序的时间复杂度更高，"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "strong",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "但在数据量较小的情况下，插入排序通常更快"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250507134538-4swivra",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250507134538-4swivra",
				"updated": "20250507134639"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "这个结论与线性查找和二分查找的适用情况的结论类似。\n快速排序这类 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "inline-math",
					"TextMarkInlineMathContent": "O(n\\log⁡n)"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 的算法属于基于分治策略的排序算法，往往包含更多单元计算操作。\n而在数据量较小时，"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "inline-math",
					"TextMarkInlineMathContent": "n^2"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 和 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "inline-math",
					"TextMarkInlineMathContent": "n\\log⁡n"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 的数值比较接近，复杂度不占主导地位，每轮中的单元操作数量起到决定性作用。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250507134538-ppuifbq",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250507134538-ppuifbq",
				"updated": "20250507134648"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "实际上，许多编程语言（例如 Java）的内置排序函数采用了插入排序，大致思路为：对于长数组，采用基于分治策略的排序算法，例如快速排序；对于短数组，直接使用插入排序。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250507134538-yet5j1h",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250507134538-yet5j1h",
				"updated": "20250507134706"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "虽然冒泡排序、选择排序和插入排序的时间复杂度都为 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "inline-math",
					"TextMarkInlineMathContent": "O(n^2)"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " ，\n但在实际情况中，"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "strong",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "插入排序的使用频率显著高于冒泡排序和选择排序"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "，主要有以下原因："
				}
			]
		},
		{
